en":"Truman Dickerson You're currently following this author!","zh":null},{"en":"Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p>\n                  You're currently following this author!\n           Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"You're currently following this author!","zh":"您目前正在关注该作者！"},{"en":"Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.","zh":null}]},{"html_en":"<p><span>Truman Dickerson is the Weekend News Fellow at Business Insider, based in New York City. He covers trending tech and business news. He previously reported for The Boston Globe's Express Desk. He graduated from Boston University, where he served as editor in chief of The Daily Free Press, BU's student-run newspaper.Contact him at Tdickerson@insider.com</span>\n              </p>","sentences":[{"en":"Truman Dickerson is the Weekend News Fellow at Business Insider, based in New York City.","zh":"杜鲁门·迪克森 (Truman Dickerson) 是《商业内幕》的周末新闻研究员，驻纽约市。"},{"en":"He covers trending tech and business news.","zh":"他报道热门科技和商业新闻。"},{"en":"He previously reported for The Boston Globe's Express Desk.","zh":"他此前曾为《波士顿环球报》的 Express Desk 进行报道。"},{"en":"He graduated from Boston University, where he served as editor in chief of The Daily Free Press, BU's student-run newspaper.Contact him at Tdickerson@insider.com","zh":"他毕业于波士顿大学，曾担任波士顿大学学生报纸《自由日报》的主编。请通过 Tdickerson@insider.com 与他联系"}]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                  <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/anthropic\" title=\"Anthropic\">Anthropic</a>\n                </li>","sentences":[{"en":"Anthropic","zh":"人择"}]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                  <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/ai\" title=\"AI\">AI</a>\n                </li>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                  <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/sam-altman\" title=\"Sam Altman\">Sam Altman</a>\n                </li>","sentences":[{"en":"Sam Altman","zh":"萨姆·奥特曼"}]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                  <span data-track-click=\"{&quot;click_text&quot;:&quot;More&quot;,&quot;click_path&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;}\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">More </span>\n                </li>","sentences":[]},{"html_en":"<li>\n                    <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/openai\" title=\"OpenAI\">OpenAI</a>\n                  </li>","sentences":[{"en":"OpenAI","zh":"开放人工智能"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><section data-content-container=\"\" role=\"main\">\n\n    \n      \n    \n      <div data-load-strategy=\"disable-lazy\" data-component-type=\"post-top\" data-e2e-name=\"post-top\">\n    \n            \n            \n          \n            \n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-byline\" data-component-type=\"post-byline\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-byline\">\n                        <p>By Truman Dickerson You're currently following this author! Click to unsubscribe from email alerts.</p>\n                      </div>\n        </div>\n\n  <section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <section id=\"post-body\" data-component-type=\"post-body\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-lock-content=\"\">\n            \n            \n            \n              <div data-e2e-name=\"post-hero\" data-component-type=\"post-hero\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\">\n                    <figure data-type=\"img\" data-e2e-name=\"image-figure-image\" data-media-container=\"image\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ImageObject\">\n                        <div>\n                          <meta itemprop=\"contentUrl\" content=\"https://i.insider.com/6ad50cece50b02f612be4b90?width=1200\">\n                          <p><img src=\"https://i.insider.com/6ad50cece50b02f612be4b90?width=700\" srcset=\"https://i.insider.com/6ad50cece50b02f612be4b90?width=400&format=jpeg&auto=webp 400w, https://i.insider.com/6ad50cece50b02f612be4b90?width=500&format=jpeg&auto=webp 500w, https://i.insider.com/6ad50cece50b02f612be4b90?width=700&format=jpeg&auto=webp 700w, https://i.insider.com/6ad50cece50b02f612be4b90?width=1000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1000w, https://i.insider.com/6ad50cece50b02f612be4b90?width=1300&format=jpeg&auto=webp 1300w, https://i.insider.com/6ad50cece50b02f612be4b90?width=2000&format=jpeg&auto=webp 2000w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 900px\" alt=\"Co-founder and CEO of Anthropic Dario Amodei looks on as US Speaker of the House Mike Johnson speaks to the press after a meeting with technology executives about artificial intelligence at the White House in Washington, DC, on September 29, 2026. The gathering comes quickly after tech giant OpenAI's cancellation of the release of its newest model due to safety concerns, and a series of revelations that the technology had gone rogue. (Photo by Kent NISHIMURA / AFP via Getty Images)\" decoding=\"sync\">\n                        </p></div>\n                    \n                          <span>\n                              <span>\n                                \n                                <label for=\"caption-drawer-btn\">\n                                          </label>\n                        \n                            <figcaption data-e2e-name=\"image-caption\">Anthropic said on Sunday that it wants to create a new LLC to fund public-interest initiatives. 西村肯特/法新社/盖蒂图片社</figcaption>\n                          </span>\n                        </span>\n                        \n                    </figure>\n              </div>\n    \n    \n    \n            \n      \n              \n      \n      \n            \n      \n              \n              \n              \n              \n      \n            \n      \n        <section data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" data-component-type=\"image-modal\" data-track-content=\"\" data-post-type=\"story\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-body-content\">\n                  \n                      <p>Anthropic said on Sunday that it would set aside large portions of its wealth to support initiatives it believes are in the public interest.</p><p>In a blog post, the AI colossus said it aims to establish a separate LLC that would use Anthropic shares to make donations to nonprofits or \"direct distributions to specific populations.\"</p><p>The new LLC, called the \"Anthropic Public Benefit Fund,\" would receive larger stakes as the company grows. The company said an initial funding round of 5% of Anthropic's shares is still subject to stockholder approval.</p><p>\"The Anthropic Public Benefit Fund will have increased flexibility and scale, enabling us to pursue our mission in new ways,\" the company said.</p><p>A 5% stake in Anthropic is worth about $48 billion, according to the company's most recent valuation in May.</p><p>In 2025, rival frontier AI company OpenAI established a similar nonprofit foundation with a multibillion-dollar stake in the company to fund public-benefit initiatives.</p>\n                  \n                  \n                  </section>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      </section>\n\n    \n    <!-- Included desktop \"post-aside\" -->    \n\n    \n      \n      <section data-component-type=\"post-bottom\" data-load-strategy=\"exclude\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-bottom\">\n        <section>\n    \n    \n            \n            \n    \n            \n            \n            <section data-component-type=\"read-next\" data-e2e-name=\"read-next\" data-display-size=\"4\" data-post-id=\"6ad50bd672a7588cd9e7143a\" data-root-margin=\"250px 0px\" data-track-view=\"{&quot;subscription_experience&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;}\">\n              <h2>阅读下一篇</h2>\n            \n              <div data-track-click-shared=\"{&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;tout_click&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;end_of_article_recirc&quot;,&quot;click_t